  "citation": "O'Brien J; Tuftedal M; Gala T; Wawrzyniak E; Grover M; Collis S; Sankaran R; Raut B; Beckman P; Ferrier N; Shahkarami S; Kim Y; Park S; Dematties D; Conrad N (2024): CROCUS Weather Data at Chicago State University Prairie Site. Community Research on Climate and Urban Science Urban Integrated Field Laboratory (CROCUS UIFL). Dataset. doi:10.15485/2482525",
